5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's get this sorted properly this time. I really want us to have a clear picture of our finances so we aren't just guessing the fees!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to understand the current state of things before we make any changes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just look at the money. We need to know who is actually showing up and doing the work.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I think we should consider the administrative burden as well. It's not just about the amount, but how it's managed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just hope we keep things friendly! I want to make sure new people still feel welcome and not stressed about the cost.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, that's a great point! But to keep it friendly, we need a stable budget. I'm going to check the bank statements and the ledger.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am curious about the attendance patterns. I'll look into the sign-in sheets and the weekday turnout.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, that's a start, but the sign-in sheets don't tell the whole story. I want to see the rota against the attendance record and the treasurer's hours.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will also look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the taster evening forms for non-joiners and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners! I want to see how people are starting out.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
