35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, the bank statements were a bit scary! It seems we can't just assume everyone pays on time. We need a structure that accounts for that.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I noticed something concerning. It seems our weekday attendance has dropped significantly since the summer outings. People seem hesitant to come.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,It's worse than that. A tiny group of people is doing all the heavy lifting while others just show up twice a year. It's not fair.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The administrative load is far higher than I expected. Chasing individual payments is consuming an unreasonable amount of the treasurer's time.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I found out that a lot of people are scared to join because they don't want to commit to a full year's fee all at once!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, that matches what I saw! People are struggling with the lump sum. Maybe we should offer a monthly option?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If people feel a barrier to entry, even a small one, they stop treating the club as their own space. We should make it feel effortless again.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, monthly payments just mean more work for the treasurer. We need to reward the people who actually contribute and show up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi is correct about the workload. If we move to monthly payments, we risk burning out the next treasurer immediately.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we make it too strict, it'll feel like a business, not a club! We should find a way to be flexible without making it a chore.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I just don't want us to guess the number again. If we have fixed costs for hall hire, we have to cover those first, right?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps a tiered system? Something that doesn't penalize the regulars but ensures the costs are covered.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""tiers"" if the people doing the work are still paying the same as the ghosts. We need a real incentive for the active members.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We must prioritize a system that is sustainable for the person managing the books. A complex tiered system might be a nightmare to track.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried that if we start tracking everything too closely, people will feel judged. Let's keep it simple and welcoming!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I agree with @Toshio on simplicity, but @Kenji on flexibility. Let's see what the options are and find a middle ground!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I hope we choose something that encourages people to return to their old habits of attending regularly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"As long as the people carrying the club aren't the ones paying for everyone else's absence, I'm open to it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for the option that minimizes the manual labor of chasing payments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll vote for whatever makes it easiest for a new person to just walk in and join us!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
